senses.gloss:
प्र-युक्ति, इस्, f. use, employment, application;
activity, inclination; impulse, instigation, incitement;
cause, motive, main object or end, occasion, conse-
quence, result.

प्राय-शस्, ind. for the most part, mostly, almost, in
all probability, always, commonly, generally, usually;
(sometimes wrongly spelt प्राय-सस्.)

प्रायिक, अस्, आ, अम्, common, usual, general.
—प्रायिक-त्व, अम्, n. likelihood, probability;
usage, custom.
